              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "FFb8Y",
                  "name": "Title",
                  "fill": "$ink",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "三个来源走同一次确认",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
                  "fontSize": 13.5,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "A63UoJ",
                  "name": "Line",
                  "fill": "$body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "从市场、从 Git URL、从本地路径都收敛到同一个确认弹窗：它带什么内容、会跑哪些脚本、装到哪个范围。一样的事不该因为你恰好点了哪个页签而得到不同的审查强度。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
                  "fontSize": 12.5,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "MMaqw",
                  "name": "Line",
                  "fill": "$body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "URL 与本地路径的「继续」也是进这个弹窗，而不是直接装。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
                  "fontSize": 12.5,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "cuBXd",
              "name": "Note 状态与动作分开",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "fill": "$canvas",
              "cornerRadius": "$radius-lg",
              "stroke": "$hairline",
              "strokeWidth": 1,
              "strokeAlignment": "inner",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 8,
              "padding": 20,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "lNHnl",
                  "name": "Title",
                  "fill": "$ink",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "状态与动作分开",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
                  "fontSize": 13.5,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "c6xiY",
                  "name": "Line",
                  "fill": "$body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "早先的版本把状态画成开关：开关只有两态，压掉了「在哪个范围启用」；而且开关和行里的按钮会同时说一件事。现在的分工是——启用范围列说状态，操作列说下一步做什么，永不同时表达两件事。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
                  "fontSize": 12.5,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "DeniF",
                  "name": "Line",
                  "fill": "$body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "插件带来的上下文开销也值得摆出来：启用的插件每一轮都会把技能与命令的名字和描述放进上下文。行里的「12 技能 · 6 命令」就是它，但不是用来吓人的，是让人能判断值不值。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
                  "fontSize": 12.5,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
